-- **100x scale:** OpenSearch becomes the bottleneck/cost center; re-architect hot search into (a) smaller “recent” window in OpenSearch and (b) high-performance columnar search (ClickHouse with text indexes) for broader interactive ranges, with strict query governance and pre-aggregated incident views.
+- The ingest gateway: agents write to Kafka directly; Kafka ACLs and TLS provide the boundary.
