-  - Rejected: fully dynamic indexing of arbitrary JSON (mapping explosion) and fully rigid schemas (constant migrations, dropped fields).
-  - Why: envelope enables fast filters and joins (trace_id/service/time); attrs preserves agility.
+  - Chose: fixed top-level columns + `attrs` map for everything else; the index only promotes an explicit allowlist.
